{"id":"39e91afa6dee441a","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-thm-kappa-cc.md","title":"$\\kappa$-Chain Condition","display":"thm-kappa-cc — $\\kappa$-Chain Condition","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-kappa-cc","aliases":["58-thm-kappa-cc"],"display":"thm-kappa-cc — $\\kappa$-Chain Condition","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-kappa-cc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-kappa-cc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kappa-cc — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-Chain Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"547a2141e41387ca\" href=\"?note=547a2141e41387ca\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md\">../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\">\\((\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\)</span> (forcing poset, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CC}_{\\kappa^+}\">\\(\\mathrm{CC}_{\\kappa^+}\\)</span> (chain-condition predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"547a2141e41387ca\" href=\"?note=547a2141e41387ca\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md\">../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\)</span> (forcing-poset predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},\\mathbb P}\\)</span> (the ambient forcing relation for the set-sized forcing poset <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kappa-cc}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{CC}_{\\kappa^+}(\\langle\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle)\\to\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},\\mathbb P}\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\check{\\kappa^+})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kappa-cc}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{CC}_{\\kappa^+}(\\langle\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle)\\to\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},\\mathbb P}\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\check{\\kappa^+})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^+\">\\(\\kappa^+\\)</span>-chain condition preserves the ground-model cardinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^+\">\\(\\kappa^+\\)</span>, but need not preserve cardinals below it.</li>\n<li>The stronger identity <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\check\\kappa)^+=\\check{\\kappa^+}\">\\((\\check\\kappa)^+=\\check{\\kappa^+}\\)</span> additionally requires that the forcing preserve <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> as a cardinal.</li>\n<li>The conclusion is explicitly metatheoretic because this atom supplies no ground-model parameter for an object-language forcing predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md","status":"resolved","id":"547a2141e41387ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-chain-condition.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ (cardinal, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":f